        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Threatening Lunge"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The rokurokubi's neck is not currently extended\n\nThe rokurokubi's head comes within an inch of their target's face before striking. They Extend their Neck, attempt to Demoralize one opponent within 20 feet, and then make a jaws Strike against that opponent. Their Demoralize check is a visual rather than auditory effect, and they don't take a penalty if the target doesn't understand their language."
